# Input to `make lock`; the hash-locked .txt beside it is what gets installed.
#
# Safety, installed into its OWN venv (.venv-safety) by `make security-deps`:
# it pins filelock<4.0, which would otherwise hold the development venv on a
# filelock with known vulnerabilities.
safety
